flowchart TB
  subgraph VM[OVHcloud VM]
    direction TB
    Web[Caddy + React]
    API[Express API]
    Collaboration[Hocuspocus + Yjs<br/>CRDT]
    Worker[Worker<br/>Node.js<br/>process]
  end
  subgraph Supabase
    direction LR
    DB[PostgreSQL]
    Storage[Object Storage]
  end
  Web -->|/api<br/>HTTP/WS| API
  Web -->|/collaboration<br/>WS| Collaboration
  Browser -->|HTTPS/WSS| Web
  API -->|read/write data<br/>queue jobs| DB
  API -->|upload/download<br/>files| Storage
  API -->|send auth email<br/>HTTPS| Resend[Resend API]
  Collaboration -->|authorize<br/>load/save Yjs| DB
  Worker -->|claim jobs<br/>record outcomes| DB
  Worker -->|read files<br/>OCR/cleanup| Storage
  Worker -->|send queued email<br/>HTTPS| Resend
